    ],
    "text": "considering the said reports. In consideration of the nature of the injuries, the Petitioner",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.131559371948242
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.73,
      283.17,
      545.08,
      299.31
    ],
    "text": "has been placed on a lowered permanent medical category under the provisions of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.196813583374023,
      12.226489067077637,
      12.30186653137207
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.78,
      305.26,
      544.32,
      321.4
    ],
    "text": "paragraph 10 of Chapter 2 of the Air Force Order No. 680, commonly referred to as the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.048439979553223,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.119085311889648,
      12.172384262084961,
      12.178346633911133
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.74,
      327.33,
      353.11,
      343.47
    ],
    "text": "Air Force Health Policy and Assigned Light Duties.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.18,
      371.49,
      544.61,
      387.64
    ],
    "text": "Thereafter a final decision was taken for invalidation of the Petitioner after one year of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.160648345947266
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.27,
      393.57,
      543.91,
      409.71
    ],
    "text": "rehabilitation with effect from 20th March 2003. The Respondents submitted that this is",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.12441349029541,
      12.01102352142334,
      12.017922401428223,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.231831550598145
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.49,
      415.89,
      543.91,
      432.03
    ],
    "text": "the procedure in regard to all personnel placed on a lowered permanent medical",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.132007598876953,
      12.222628593444824,
      12.226489067077637
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.92,
      438.21,
      543.32,
      454.36
    ],
    "text": "category. In keeping with this decision, the petitioner was invalidated with effect from",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.169898986816406,
      12.232820510864258
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.21,
      460.29,
      543.92,
      476.43
    ],
    "text": "20th May 2004. The Petitioner made a complaint to the Human Rights Commission and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.12441349029541,
      11.752665519714355,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.15975284576416,
      12.183462142944336,
      12.295963287353516
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.01,
      482.37,
      543.45,
      498.51
    ],
    "text": "the Human Rights Commission in its recommendation dated 7/11/2006, after",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.114241600036621,
      12.21767807006836,
      12.333595275878906
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.67,
      504.22,
      543.95,
      520.36
    ],
    "text": "considering the facts and circumstances of the Petitioner's application, has not made",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.131709098815918,
      12.31464672088623,
      12.337273597717285
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.68,
      526.54,
      543.37,
      542.68
    ],
    "text": "any observations on the cause of the injury caused to the Petitioner but recommended",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.170842170715332,
      12.226489067077637,
      12.451251983642578
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.77,
      548.61,
      543.36,
      564.75
    ],
    "text": "that the Petitioner be paid a permanent pension. The Respondents submitted that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.105998992919922,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.222628593444824,
      12.239446640014648
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.39,
      570.69,
      542.97,
      586.83
    ],
    "text": "said recommendation cannot be implemented due to the provisions of the Air Force",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.106148719787598,
      12.229259490966797
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.25,
      593.01,
      543.01,
      609.15
    ],
    "text": "Pension Scheme. The said Pension Scheme provides in section 19(1)(b) that, a person to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.264581680297852
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.08,
      615.09,
      542.87,
      631.23
    ],
    "text": "be entitled for pension has to complete a period of 12 years. In the case of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.01,
      637.18,
      543.46,
      653.33
    ],
    "text": "Petitioner, he has only completed 7 years in service; therefore the Petitioner is not",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11613941192627,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.164727210998535
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      81.95,
      659.02,
      542.49,
      675.16
    ],
    "text": "entitled to the benefit of pension. As there is a specific provision in the Air Force",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11773681640625
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.02,
      680.86,
      542.51,
      697.0
    ],
    "text": "Pension Scheme in relation to the award of pension; that a person has to complete a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.120233535766602,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.25451374053955
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      81.98,
      702.94,
      542.83,
      719.08
    ],
    "text": "given period, and as this Petitioner has not fulfilled that requirement, the Petitioner",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.251303672790527,
      12.39139175415039
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      81.72,
      724.78,
      352.22,
      740.92
    ],
    "text": "cannot claim it as of right that he be paid a pension.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11613941192627,
      12.145713806152344,
      12.151241302490234,
      12.175564765930176,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.375024795532227
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      304.99,
      71.43,
      313.76,
      87.04
    ],
    "text": "4",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.14,
      128.62,
      538.75,
      144.76
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner has also claimed that the decision for not to grant him\" combat casualty",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.108197212219238,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.251303672790527,
      12.8571138381958
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.31,
      150.69,
      539.12,
      166.83
    ],
    "text": "status\" was wrong as the injury he sustained is from a terrorist attack and therefore he",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11613941192627,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.237469673156738,
      12.244290351867676
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.22,
      173.01,
      539.32,
      189.15
    ],
    "text": "has sought in this application that the said decision should be quashed by a Writ of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.109246253967285,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.162936210632324,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.193389892578125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.1,
      195.09,
      538.38,
      211.23
    ],
    "text": "Certiorari. The Petitioner's main claim that the injury was caused by a terrorist attack is",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.162936210632324,
      12.178744316101074
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.11,
      217.18,
      539.01,
      233.32
    ],
    "text": "only supported by a statement in Form 551 issued on 8/10/1998. That is a standard",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.894403457641602,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.100299835205078,
      12.102299690246582,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.220747947692871,
      12.226489067077637
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.86,
      239.01,
      539.05,
      255.15
    ],
    "text": "form in which certain questions are raised and the answers to these questions are left",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.101099967956543,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      261.33,
      539.05,
      277.47
    ],
    "text": "blank, to be filled by the Commanding Officer. One of the questions raised was: \"Was",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.109395980834961,
      12.163931846618652
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.97,
      283.41,
      538.83,
      299.55
    ],
    "text": "the injury due to his own fault, i.e., did it arise from negligence or misconduct or any",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.17382526397705,
      12.190014839172363,
      12.306389808654785,
      12.309289932250977
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.77,
      305.73,
      538.32,
      321.88
    ],
    "text": "blameworthy cause within his own control?\" This question was answered in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.309289932250977
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.74,
      327.81,
      538.42,
      343.99
    ],
    "text": "negative \"No\". The other question posed was, \"If so, state what way?\" This question",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.125373840332031,
      12.313859939575195,
      12.669394493103027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.73,
      349.65,
      345.14,
      365.79
    ],
    "text": "was answered as \"Due to terrorist gunshot attack.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.120133399963379,
      12.169252395629883,
      12.257129669189453
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.42,
      394.04,
      538.05,
      410.19
    ],
    "text": "The Respondents' position is that the aforesaid document was filled and issued",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.160598754882812,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.237469673156738
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.59,
      416.37,
      538.08,
      432.51
    ],
    "text": "subsequent to the incident report which was the 1st information with regard to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.218533515930176,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.15079402923584,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.169898986816406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.65,
      438.21,
      537.72,
      454.35
    ],
    "text": "incident and that report clearly stated, the injury was due to misfire of his own weapon.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.15079402923584,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.229259490966797,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.309289932250977,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.42,
      460.3,
      538.43,
      476.44
    ],
    "text": "The Commander who has filled the aforesaid Form 551 has, by his subsequent letter",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.98151969909668,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.21044635772705,
      12.255205154418945
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.4,
      482.62,
      538.59,
      498.76
    ],
    "text": "dated 17th December 2003, rectified his error and has stated that the Form 551, which",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.369707107543945,
      12.08428955078125,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.116289138793945,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.26,
      504.93,
      538.63,
      521.07
    ],
    "text": "has stated gunshot injury due to enemy fire was due to oversight and the document",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.10469913482666,
      12.203804969787598,
      12.229259490966797,
      12.237469673156738,
      12.306389808654785
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.23,
      527.25,
      537.61,
      543.39
    ],
    "text": "F551 cannot be used as evidence, and he has confirmed that the injury caused to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.943994522094727,
      12.100000381469727,
      12.106148719787598,
      12.11613941192627,
      12.166715621948242,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.27,
      549.33,
      376.52,
      565.47
    ],
    "text": "Airman was sustained due to misfire of his own weapon.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.306389808654785,
      12.309289932250977
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.24,
      593.25,
      537.49,
      609.39
    ],
    "text": "Whether the injury of the Airman was caused by a misfire of his own weapon or by a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.204251289367676,
      12.243647575378418
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.26,
      615.33,
      537.76,
      631.47
    ],
    "text": "terrorist attack is a question of fact and it has to be decided on consideration of material",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.110595703125,
      12.237469673156738
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      76.91,
      637.65,
      537.74,
      653.79
    ],
    "text": "evidence and the circumstances. The relevant officers after careful consideration of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      76.91,
      659.49,
      537.72,
      675.63
    ],
    "text": "facts have come to the conclusion that the injury caused to the Petitioner was due to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.132356643676758,
      12.251008033752441,
      12.306389808654785
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.01,
      681.34,
      537.68,
      697.48
    ],
    "text": "misfire of the Petitioner's own weapon. The application before me is a judicial review",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.309289932250977
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      76.93,
      703.42,
      537.64,
      719.56
    ],
    "text": "application and this Court, in judicial review proceedings considers on the legality of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.110595703125,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.26,
      725.25,
      537.52,
      741.39
    ],
    "text": "the decision and not on questions of fact, whether the decision by the relevant officers",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.226489067077637,
      12.251303672790527,
      12.31464672088623
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      305.36,
      71.19,
      314.13,
      86.8
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      79.08,
      106.77,
      539.28,
      122.91
    ],
    "text": "are right or wrong, but in considering the facts and circumstances, the decision that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.11773681640625,
      12.178744316101074,
      12.237469673156738,
      12.536236763000488
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      78.86,
      128.86,
      538.88,
      145.0
    ],
    "text": "injury was caused due to misfire of the Airman's own weapon cannot be considered as",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.147506713867188,
      12.160648345947266,
      12.168704986572266,
      12.243647575378418,
      12.306389808654785
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      150.94,
      539.28,
      167.08
